+// ---- Vision transcription (dsh-media-skills HARNESS_PATCH v3, 0.1.1-rc.2) ----
+// A text-only model session that receives an image is no longer rejected at
+// admission. Instead the image is persisted and surfaced immediately, the
+// agent/pre-step hook transcribes it through the first vision-capable route
+// (registration order is the failover chain), and the llm layer's native
+// request-level image projection (projectImagesForTextModel, upstream since
+// 0.1.1-rc.2) is the safety net for text-only requests.
